00:05:00,384 --> 00:05:08,624
so think of it a bit like exposing a photograph from a negative.

36
00:05:08,784 --> 00:05:16,900
so you have a pattern and you expose light through it, and the surface of the wafer then chemically reacts to that.

37
00:05:17,294 --> 00:05:19,172
And then the wafers are loaded out.

38
00:05:21,038 --> 00:05:25,264
