00:19:46,286 --> 00:19:55,140
The key point of it was that we broke it into those those different components as mentioned.

145
00:19:56,912 --> 00:20:01,152
so we have at the top the control logic, which is implemented in COCO.

146
00:20:01,614 --> 00:20:09,924
In the middle in blue, we have all of our algorithms, which in many senses are crown jewels, if you will.

