00:20:10,752 --> 00:20:15,108
that's where we really are doing the calculations that get us the nanometers.

148
00:20:15,792 --> 00:20:29,668
we have all of the data which was implemented using this internal tool, and then we have some common facilities, so things like test facilities, decorators that provide some sort of helpers and so on.

149
00:20:30,446 --> 00:20:33,252
And initially we only brought this out for one system.

